        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amboolela ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wo mundu boolela Baisiraeli kano: Enywe muli sibala sie sifwabi, khwako mu lirima liase ndikho mbaukuuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babemeelesi bali nga chitalang'i chiulukhuma ne chiira chisaang'i nicho chiaayile. Beera babaandu babukule chirupia choosi nende buli nisio banyala khunyoola, khulwe bubwiri bwabwe bareerao bunamulekhwa bukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bal. 10.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basaayi ba Isiraeli bafunile lilaka liase mala banyaaluutiisie bibiindu biase bitakatifu. Se baukhasia akari we bibiindu bitakatifu nende birumikha busiele tawe, namwe se bekisia bubwabukhani buuli akari we sinyaalu ne sikwalaafu tawe. Lundi balekeelesia chisabato chase ne khu khuufwolobia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babemeelesi mu Isiraeli bali nga bisuuche biilikho ne biira esaang'i. Beera babaandu, bachukha sifuki khulwe khunyoola bukhala bukhali bwa ng'ali tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bang'oosi ba Isiraeli bakisile bubwoni buno nga baakha lisiisi luloongo, babona kamalola ke bubeeyi ne khung'oola bubeeyi. Bekhola khulomaloma likhuwa lio Mwami WELE Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne kakhali ese Omwami WELE se nalomaloomekho nabo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayiinda babea lundi banuula, bapia bataambi ne babanani siibi, ne lundi banyoola bukhala mu khubea bakeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayiima omundu mu nibo oonyala oombakha lisiisi, mala eema akari we sibaanga sie lisiisi litechuukhe nio ndekhe khubunia sibala, ne kakhali se namunyoolamo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese Omwami WELE ndoma ndi, ‘Nabaambiile lirima, ndaboosia ne kumulilo, ndababunia khulwe bikholwa biabwe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
